<title>SPAIN: Cepsa interim dividend 60 ptas gross.</title>
<headline>Cepsa interim dividend 60 ptas gross.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish oil firm Cia Espanola de Petroleos SA (CEPSA) will pay an interim dividend of 60 pesetas gross, 45 pesetas net, according to a bulletin issued by the Madrid bourse.</p>
<p>The payment date is October 28.</p>
<p>Cepsa's net attributable profit fell 20.5 percent in the first half to 9.2 billion pesetas. In 1995, it paid a total gross dividend of 120 pesetas.</p>
<p>Cepsa traded down 10 pesetas to 3,920 at 0815 GMT.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
